== How to add a DVD cover ==

If you want to add the image of a DVD to an album that shows this image, '''do not modify this page or image'''. The correct procedure is:

{|
|-
| 1. || go to [[:w:Special:Upload]] to upload the image
|-
| 2. || go back to the album page, click edit, and change the following:
|-
| || <pre>
{{Infobox Film
...
| image          = NoDVDcover.png
</pre>
|-
| || into:
|-
| || <pre>
{{Infobox Film
...
| image          = Name of image you have uploaded
</pre>
|}

Add the line "image = " if not present already.

Do not include the "Image:" part in the name of the image.

== Why you don't want to change <u>this</u> image ==

The image described in this page is used to indicate that no DVD cover image has been placed in a particular album page. As a result, it must not be changed with a specific album cover image. Follow the above instructions for inserting a new album cover image.

